    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "You can make any element a flexbox by applying display: flex; to it."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Example"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "html",
      "content": "1<div class=\"container\">\n2    <div class=\"box box1\">First Item</div>\n3    <div class=\"box box2\">Second Item</div>\n4    <div class=\"box box3\">Third Item</div>\n5</div>"
    },
    {
      "type": "code",
      "language": "css",
      "content": "1.container {\n2    display: flex;\n3}"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "In this example, you won't notice much visual change yet. The real power of flexbox will now become clear as you start using its flex properties."
    },
